### Get All Products (Public)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?skip=0&take=10

### Create Product (Must be Seller)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
{
    "name": "Modern Dashboard UI Kit",
    "price": "25.50",
    "stock": "100"
}

### Create Product (Must be Seller)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "name": "Mobile App",
    "price": "2500",
    "stock": "10"
}

### Update Product
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/products/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "price": 19.99,
    "stock": 50
}


### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/products/6
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Get Products For Specific Seller (Must be Seller)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/my-products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE







